    podcastName: "Acquired",
    hosts: "Ben Gilbert & David Rosenthal",
    tldl: `The Acquired team presents a theatrical live show at Radio City Music Hall, featuring notable CEOs and media personalities, culminating in a unique video special available on Spotify.`,
    whatHappened: `The excitement was palpable as the Acquired team unveiled their full live show from Radio City Music Hall, a culmination of months of preparation. They wanted to elevate the experience beyond a typical podcast episode, crafting something reminiscent of a concert film or stand-up comedy special, perfectly suited to the grandeur of the venue. This ambitious project showcases a vibrant interplay of business insights and entertainment, highlighting the importance of engaging storytelling in the world of finance and entrepreneurship.

Central to this special are conversations with influential figures like Jamie Dimon, the CEO of JPMorgan Chase, who provides a deep dive into the intricacies of the banking world. Meredith Kobit-Levian, the CEO of the New York Times, shares her vision for the future of media, while Barry Diller and Andrew Ross Sorkin add their own perspectives, making the event a rich tapestry of thought leadership. The show also features fun cameos from recognizable faces in the audience, enhancing the atmosphere and connecting the dots between iconic companies and their leaders.

To ensure that the experience reaches a wider audience, the Acquired team decided to release the full video on Spotify, utilizing the platform's new capability to host full video podcasts. This decision reflects their commitment to delivering high-quality content and making it accessible on various devices, inviting listeners to immerse themselves in the Acquired Cinematic Universe. The show is not just a podcast; it’s an event that embodies the intersection of business, culture, and entertainment in a uniquely engaging format.`,
    keyInsights: [`The live show at Radio City Music Hall was designed to be more than a standard podcast, resembling a concert film or comedy special.`, `Jamie Dimon discussed the intricacies of the banking industry, providing unique insights into financial leadership.`, `Meredith Kobit-Levian emphasized the evolving landscape of media and her vision for the New York Times.`, `The full video was released on Spotify, highlighting the platform's capabilities and the team's dedication to high-quality content delivery.`],
