    keyInsights: [`Marcus Mumford's upbringing in a religious household significantly influenced his creative expression and worldview.`, `Both Dax and Marcus have navigated sobriety and discuss the impact of addiction on their lives.`, `The pressures of fame can complicate personal identity, leading to challenges in self-understanding and public perception.`, `Shared experiences of personal growth often arise from confronting vulnerabilities and the passage of time.`],
